cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below."
title: "ONIONTRACE"
abstract: >-
  A passive-only OSINT pipeline that proposes links between Tor onion services
  and records how strongly the evidence supports each link. Correlation is
  measured on a synthetic farm with known operator clusters, flaws, personas,
  decoys and hard negatives, because no public ground truth for operator
  identity exists.
type: software
